[43.547196, "o", "</head><body bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" background=\"https://s.turbifycdn.com/aah/paulgraham/bel-6.gif\" text=\"#000000\" link=\"#000099\" vlink=\"#464646\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td><map name=c39a69594cd731d><area shape=rect coords=\"0,0,67,21\" href=\"index.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,21,67,42\" href=\"articles.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,42,67,63\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/0596006624\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,63,67,84\" href=\"books.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,84,67,105\" href=\"http://ycombinator.com\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,105,67,126\" href=\"arc.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,126,67,147\" href=\"bel.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,147,67,168\" href=\"lisp.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,168,67,189\" href=\"antispam.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,189,67,210\" href=\"kedrosky.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,210,67,231\" href=\"faq.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,231,67,252\" href=\"raq.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,252,67,273\" href=\"quo.html\"><area shape=r"]
[43.547269, "o", "ect coords=\"0,273,67,294\" href=\"rss.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,294,67,315\" href=\"bio.html\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,315,67,336\" href=\"https://twitter.com/paulg\"><area shape=rect coords=\"0,336,67,357\" href=\"https://mas.to/@paulg\"></map><img src=\"https://s.turbifycdn.com/aah/paulgraham/bel-7.gif\" width=\"69\" height=\"357\" usemap=#c39a69594cd731d border=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" ismap /></td><td><img src=\"https://sep.turbifycdn.com/ca/Img/trans_1x1.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"26\" border=\"0\" /></td><td><a href=\"index.html\"><img src=\"https://s.turbifycdn.com/aah/paulgraham/bel-8.gif\" width=\"410\" height=\"45\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" /></a><br /><br /><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"435\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"435\"><img src=\"https://s.turbifycdn.com/aah/paulgraham/the-list-of-n-\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K-3.gif\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" alt=\"The List of N \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KThings\u001b[m\u001b[K\" /><br /><br /><font size=\"2\" face=\"verdana\">September 2009<br /><br />I bet you the current issue of <i>Cosmopolitan</i> has an article\r\nwhose \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[K begins with a number. \"7 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KThings\u001b[m\u001b[K He Won't Tell You about\r\nthey attract readers.<br /><br />Why do readers like the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K so much?   Mainly because\r\nStructurally, the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is a degenerate case of essay.\r\nAn essay can go anywhere the writer wants.  In a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\nthat corresponds to such an outline.  In a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K, this\r\n"]
[43.547296, "o", "ones, and no particular connection between them.<br /><br />Because the main points are unconnected, the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is parallel and therefore fault tolerant.<br /><br />There are times when this format is what a writer wants.  One, obviously,\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.  I once wrote an essay about the <a href=\"startupmistakes.html\">mistakes that kill startups</a>, and a few people made fun of me\r\nfor writing something whose \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[K began with a number.  But in that\r\nindependent \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.  In fact, one of the questions I was trying to\r\n"]
[43.547368, "o", "sometimes play it safe and make the talk a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.<br /><br />The list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is easier for writers as well as readers.  When\r\nThe compartmentalized structure of the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K protects\r\nto, and the essay will still survive.<br /><br />Writing a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is so relaxing.  You think of n/2 of\r\nlist of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.  It's like the sort of programming where you write\r\na week cranking up the resolution.<br /><br />Because the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is easier for writers too, it's not\r\nmuch confidence in the writer.  The list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is in that\r\nweird and artistic.  The list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K similarly limits the\r\n"]
[43.547419, "o", "be about whatever the \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[K says, and the format prevents the writer\r\nfrom indulging in any flights of fancy.<br /><br />Because the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is the easiest essay form, it should\r\nreally a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K for n = 3.  But the students writing them\r\n"]
[43.547481, "o", "<font color=#999999>[<a href=\"#f2n\"><font color=#999999>2</font></a>]</font><br /><br />It seems a fine plan to start students off with the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.\r\nit openly?  Let them write lists of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K like the pros, with\r\nnumbers and no transitions or \"conclusion.\"<br /><br />There is one case where the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is a dishonest format:\r\nto be about <i>the</i> 7 secrets of success.  That kind of \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[K is the\r\n"]
[43.547534, "o", "you've made an exhaustive list.  But evidence suggests most \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\nwith \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[Ks like this are linkbait.<br /><br />The greatest weakness of the list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K is that there's so\r\nin the course of writing it.<br /><br />This can only happen in a very limited way in a list of n \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kthings\u001b[m\u001b[K.\r\nYou make the \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Ktitle\u001b[m\u001b[K first, and that's what it's going to be about.\r\n"]
