[137.102639, "o", "DS essay length: 25090 characters\r\nFM essay length: 6910 characters\r\n\r\nFirst 200 chars of DS: Do Things that Don't Scale --> Want to start a startup? Get funded by Y Combinator . July 2013 One of the most common types of advice we give at Y Combinator is to do things that don't scale. A lot of\r\n\r\nFirst 200 chars of FM: Founder Mode --> September 2024 At a YC event last week Brian Chesky gave a talk that everyone who was there will remember. Most founders I talked to afterward said it was the best they'd ever heard. \r\n"]
